/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Our outstanding ahievements are the result of a collective effort, and we are immensely grateful to our dedicated employees, collaborators, and business partners. We believe in transparency and information sharing to build trust and strengthen our relationships with all stakeholders. Committed to continuous improvement, we actively seek feedback and suggestions from both team members and partners to optimise our performance. )
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
382 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Every success and every new opportunity stems from a shared sense of belonging and brand identity that we strive to strengthen day after day. Our Benefit Corporation status heightens our awareness of our environmental and social impact. This translates into innovative solutions that optimise resource use, and reduce inequalities by fostering greater access to employment opportunities. )
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
383 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Our unwavering commitment to sustainability and a responsible approach to our social impact has always been the cornerstone of our corporate mission. This dedication has been further solidified by our transition to a Benefit Corporation. The primary objective of this report remains to document the efforts and results we have achieved in relation to these key areas; promoting employee well-being and social inclusion, actively supporting the local communities where we operate, and reducing pollution and waste. )
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [7]
>>
