453 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (We serve as a main intermediary, offering a comphrensive portfolio of motor and life insurance solutions. In the motor insurance space, we specialise in fleet management \(including MTPL documentation and coverage\), individual policies \(MTPL and MOD\), and sustainable mobility options. Regarding life insurance, we offer expertise in areas such as medical reimbursement, permanent disability, term life and long-term care insurance. Beyond client services, we foster strategic partnerships with top national and international insurance companies. This collaboration allows us to support our valued customers in managing their products and act as a direct point of contact for inquiries and policy activations.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
