528 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Our strong partnerships with key players in the insurance market enable us to provide clients with innovative insurance solutions and bespoke products. By partnering with Acrisure, a global InsurTech leader, we deliver integrated insurance solutions powered by cutting-edge digital tools. This simplifies the process and enhances the customer experience for a smoother journey. )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
529 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (We specialise in assistance and claims handling for customers with MTPL and MOD insurance policies. The critical role of efficient and swift claims processing is reflected in our operations, with our highly qualified claims department providing dedicated step-by-step support throughout the entire process in the event of a covered loss. )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
