535 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (We excel at developing MTPL programs that control costs and offer innovative solutions like operational leases, showcasing our expertise in finding solutions. We constantly benchmark the national insurance and reinsurance markets and thoroughly analyse the technical performance of risks. Through our approach, partners consistently receive the most technically and economically advantageous offer, ensuring a sustainable risk profile for the company. The motor division currently manages a fleet of vehicles that places us at the top of the national broker ratings. )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [17]
>>
