/ActualText (We help entities find the best balance between economic and qualitative factors when choosing between risk shares to be managed autonomously and risk shared to be transferred to third parties through insurance coverage. Our intermediation work allows the entity to find the insurance company that offers the most suitable product and complies with its specific needs. We assist the entity in all phases of the tender and assist in the complex procedures of the new procurement code. )
