/P 1701 0 R
/ActualText (C. Reduce environmental impact by prioritising the critical issue of sudden and unpredictable climate change. We aim to avoid wasting resources and promote sustainable lifestyles for the benefit of the environment and our people. We will do this by \(i\) empowering staff to reduce greenhouse gas emissions for company activites and work-related travel, \(ii\) procuring renewable energy sources, \(iii\) gradually converting our car fleet to hybrid/electric models;)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
