<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1702 0 R
/ActualText (D. Support projects of collective interest in collaboration with public institutions, local authorities, businesses, and both profit and non-profit organisations. We aim to align our goals with these partners and amplify the positive impact of their work;)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [7]
>>
