605 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1713 0 R
/ActualText (Acrisure Italia is committed to creating a workplace where everyone feels valued and respected. We believe that diversity and inclusion are essential to our success, and we are committed to promoting equal opportunities for our employees. We also believe that a healthy work-life balance is important, and we offer a variety of programs and benefits to help employees achieve this. In addition to our commitment to our employees, we also strive to help the local community. We support a variety of initiatives that focus on education, environmental sustainability, and social justice. We believe that these initiatives are important to making our community a better place to live and work. )
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
606 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Formalising our Benefit Corporation status solidified our ongoing dedication to sustainability. We have always championed innovation in all its forms, recognising its role in driving lasting, environmentally resonsible growth. We have embarked on a journey to ensure the long-term viability of our business model, focussing on three key objectives: )
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
