622 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Committed to a greener future, we completed the renovation of our Sassari office in 2023. The project included the installation of innovative Aluinvent panels, made entirely from recyled and recyclable aluminium. These panels act as a solar shield, significantly reducing energy usage in both hot and cold weather.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
623 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Solar Panel installation:)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
624 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (In a continued effort to reduce our carbon footprint, we installed state-of-the-art solar panels on the roof of our headquarters. This investment will significantly reduce our CO2 emissions and help us achieve our sustainability goals. )
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [5]
>>
