/P 1726 0 R
/ActualText (A good working environment starts with ensuring a good quality of life for our staff. We have provided employees with a life insurance policy taken out through our partners. Furthermore, we have made a commitment to ensuring that working at Acrisure can create a real advantage to their lives, thanks to the provision of fuel and electricity bonuses. )
