646 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The fast pace of office life, full of goals, deadlines, and service-level agreements to be met, can be stimulating, but sometimes isolating. To combat this, we priotise creating opportunities for team building activities. These gatherings are a great change to learn from each other, sharing skills and knowledge, and ultimately, to feel like valued members of our team. )
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [5]
>>
