648 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (We offer our employees the opportunity to participate in a free English language course offered by the company. Lessons are held on Monday to Thursday in person at our Sassari office and remotely for the Rome and Milan offices. The levels are divided into three, based on the Common European Framework of Reference for Languages.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [7]
>>
