/P 1736 0 R
/ActualText (2023 presented significant challenges, but it was also a year of significant progress for us as a Benefit Corporation. We actively pursued goals and standards that define our mission, integrating them into our everyday business strategies. At the core of being a Benefit Corporation lies the pursuit of shared benefits. This means every decision we make considers not just its commercial viability, but also its long-term social and environmental impact. To measure our progress in this area, we utilised two key tools: the Materiality Analysis and the B Impact Assessment. Both methodologies provided valuable insights into our activities throughout the year and helped us chart a course for the future. The assessments highlighted our strengths, areas where we excel and should continue to focus, while also identifying areas for improvement. This allows us to develop stronger strategies and refine our approach to achieving our goals. )
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
