/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (A major step in measuring our impact has been the B Impact Assessment. This online self-evaluation tool \(bimpactassessment.net\) allows companies to assess their sustainability levels across five key areas: community, environment, customers, governance, and employees. By answering a series of multiple-choice and open-ended questions, we received a comprehensive sustainability score. The assessment highlighted areas where we excel, but also revealed opportunities for improvement. This valuable insight has fueled the development of new projects that will enhance our sustainable impact in the coming years. )
/E (A major step in measuring our impact has been the B Impact Assessment. This online self-evaluation tool \(bimpactassessment.net\) allows companies to assess their sustainability levels across five key areas: community, environment, customers, governance, and employees. By answering a series of multiple-choice and open-ended questions, we received a comprehensive sustainability score. The assessment highlighted areas where we excel, but also revealed opportunities for improvement. This valuable insight has fueled the development of new projects that will enhance our sustainable impact in the coming years. )
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
