<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (We achieved a score of 53.9 on the B Corp Assessment, which is a stepping stone towards B Corp Certification. This prestigious designation recognises companies that meet rigorous standards for social and environmental responsibility. While we have not reached the minimum threshold of 80 \(on a 200-point scale\) yet, we are actively working towards achieving it. We believe that B Corp Certification will sugnificantly benefit all our stakeholders. Throughout 2023, we focused on establishing a sustainable foundation for our future projects through various initiatives. The following data showcases our initial progress, categorized by thematic areas. )
/E (We achieved a score of 53.9 on the B Corp Assessment, which is a stepping stone towards B Corp Certification. This prestigious designation recognises companies that meet rigorous standards for social and environmental responsibility. While we have not reached the minimum threshold of 80 \(on a 200-point scale\) yet, we are actively working towards achieving it. We believe that B Corp Certification will sugnificantly benefit all our stakeholders. Throughout 2023, we focused on establishing a sustainable foundation for our future projects through various initiatives. The following data showcases our initial progress, categorized by thematic areas. )
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [1]
>>
