<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Effective governance relies on a clear framework. This includes rules and regulations, such as laws, that apply to organisations, regardless of size, purpose \(profit or non-profit\), or sector \(public or private\). This system guides decision-making, including the methods and tools used to achieve goals. To make well-rounded decisions, it is fundamental to consider the expectation of stakeholders and potential consequences of actions. Additionally, fostering a culture of social responsbility among employees is crucial. )
