/P 1866 0 R
/ActualText (Our Benefit Corporation status reflects our commitment to a broader purpose. We go beyond profit, aiming to create shared value with everyone affected by our operations,)
/Pg 34 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
939 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1867 0 R
/ActualText (Our business model was legally recognised by law No. 208 of December 28, 2015 \(Sections 376-383 and es 4-5\). The aforementioned law entered into force on January 1, 2016. Through this legislative initative,  Benefit Corporations were introduced as a novel legal form of business organisation. This legislative advancement has empowered companies opting for this classification to embed and preserve their long-term values within their statute. )
/Pg 34 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
940 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1868 0 R
/ActualText (Becoming a Benefit Corporation is the official recognition of our core values. This achievement is the result of our ongoing efforts, which have not always been straightforward. We are proud to present our first impact report, outlining our goals for 2024 and the years ahead.)
/Pg 34 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
941 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1869 0 R
/ActualText (We will provide ongiong updates on our goals in future reports, issued annually from now on. These reports will reflect the strategies we put in place and the outcomes we achieve overtime, all in the spirit of full transparency regarding our work. )
/Pg 34 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
942 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (We recognise where we stand. Concerned by the state of our planet, we are committed to doing our part for a better future. We will work on creating real solutions, not just following trends. These issues are critical and affect everyone. By making conscious choices, we can all be ambassadors for sustainable development. )
/E (We recognise where we stand. Concerned by the state of our planet, we are committed to doing our part for a better future. We will work on creating real solutions, not just following trends. These issues are critical and affect everyone. By making conscious choices, we can all be ambassadors for sustainable development. )
/Pg 34 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
943 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Accurate information is key to changing outdated mindsets. Thankfully, new generations are passionate about environmental and social responsibility. They embrace ethical and inclusive practices. The key to success lies in asking the right questions, setting achievable goals based on our starting point, and using data and resources efficiently. While we focus on realistic and meausurable targets, we will not shy away from courageous and bold actions to ensure a better future for all. )
/E (Accurate information is key to changing outdated mindsets. Thankfully, new generations are passionate about environmental and social responsibility. They embrace ethical and inclusive practices. The key to success lies in asking the right questions, setting achievable goals based on our starting point, and using data and resources efficiently. While we focus on realistic and meausurable targets, we will not shy away from courageous and bold actions to ensure a better future for all. )
/Pg 34 0 R
/K [4]
>>
