<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1874 0 R
/ActualText (PARTNERSHIP: Choosing the right partners is essential to our business strategy. We look for partners who share our values and who are committed to building long-term, mutually beneficial relationships. These partnerships allow us to achieve our goals more effectively and efficiently, and they help us to create a more sustainable future for our business.)
/Pg 35 0 R
/K [16]
>>
endobj
967 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (PLANET: We maintain a steadfast commitment to continually minimising our environmental footprint. This dedication is demonstrably evidenced by our ongoing initiatives. Notably, the structural refurbishment of our main headquarters will aid in reducing our environmental impact. This initiative is strategically aligned with our energy effiency program with the installation of solar panels, aiming to reduce our energy consumption. Additionally, we have embraced the dematerialisation of documents, discouraging paper usage and promoting a paperless work environment. All in order to foster a more sustainable future.)
/Pg 35 0 R
/K [17]
>>
endobj
