972 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Being sustainable means being innovative and more efficient in transforming challenges into opportunities. Sustainability implies the creation of shared value, a value that benefits the company together with all its stakeholders. Until recently, the future of our planet and humanity itself did not seem to be a problem for individual entrepreneurs, managers and ordinary citizens, but only for national and international political institutions. Today, however, we cannot ignore what events and science show us every day.)
/Pg 36 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
973 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Barbara Santoro)
/Pg 36 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
974 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Pensare sostenibile: Una Bella Impresa)
/Pg 36 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
975 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (We are confident that actively promoting these ideals and taking concrete steps, both large and small, will foster a growing sense of environmental awareness and commitment within our organisation. Our ultimate goal is to cultivate a hollistic approach to ecological thinking, driving a comprehensive vision of corporate sustainability. This vision will permeate all aspects of our operations and naturally engage every employee. To achieve this, we must not only disseminate these principles through formal channels like company communications, but also through initiatives that empower individuals to contribute directly.)
/Pg 36 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
976 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1875 0 R
/ActualText (Ultimately, transforming our business model requires a gradual shift in our corporate mindset. We must move beyond our current practices and fully embrace the values of sustainable development.)
/Pg 36 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
977 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Through ongoing evolution, we at Acrisure have realised that simply adapting to the issues and innovations outlined in the 2030 Agenda would not sufficiently address the commitments we, as a company, must take ownership of. To effectively implement these advancements, we require a more agile and responsive approach. This reduces bureaucratic hurdles and fosters timely, yet measured actions. )
/Pg 36 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
978 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1876 0 R
/ActualText (As a Benefit Corporation, our progress is built on a series of achievable, impactful steps that align with our core values. This does not prevent us from setting ambitious long-term goals that will require sustained dedication in the coming years.)
/Pg 36 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
