988 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1881 0 R
/ActualText (ACRISURE SUSTAINABILITY has adopted a green leaf to identify our year-round social and environmental impact initiatives. We want to go beyond just initiatives however, and ACRISURE SUSAINABILITY will both educate and inspire. We aim to express our values and efforts in various ways, from adversiting campaigns to engaging communcation initiatives on the topic, promoting events and calls to action. By speaking directly to our readers through our communication channels, we strive to empower them with knowledge and encourage maximum participation of all those involved in our sustainability journey. )
