1006 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1885 0 R
/ActualText (Our roots are firmly anchored in the world of insurance consulting and brokerage. Since our foundation, we have been committed to a set of principles which lie at the heart of everything we do, including but not limited to, fairness; professionalism; independence; and transparency. Fundamentally, respect is the core value which guides our interactions with all stakeholders, from clients and suppliers; to employees and the community. )
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
1007 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1886 0 R
/ActualText (OUR COMMITMENT TO A SUSTAINABLE FUTURE)
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
1008 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1887 0 R
/ActualText <>
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
1009 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (In the face of the urgent climate crisis, we are taking a proactive approach by integrating relevant regulations and industry best-practices into our decision-making processes. Through this commitment, we aim to achieve a quantifiable reduction in our environmental footprint.)
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
1010 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (We are committed to building a sustainable future by setting medium- and long-term goals that priortize resource conservation, waste reduction, proper waste disposal \(including e-waste\), and emissions reduction. )
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
1011 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1888 0 R
/ActualText (Responsible procurement, sustainable resource use, consumption reduction, and minimal waste generation are now fundamental business practices. While we acknowledge limitations in directly controlling the environmental impact of our entire supply chain, we are committed to collaborating with suppliers and partners who share our commitment to sustainability. This collaborative approach, coupled with selecting suppliers aligned with our ethical principles, ensures social responsibility is embedded throughout our operations. Our focus on minimising our ecological footprint extends beyond the supply chain. We are actively fostering a sustainable and inclusive work environment that prioritises the well-being of all employees. )
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
1012 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /Figure
/P 318 0 R
/Pg 39 0 R
>>
endobj
1013 0 obj
