/T (ESG STRATEGY 2024)
/E (ESG STRATEGY 2024)
/Pg 40 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
1015 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (PLANS FOR THE FUTURE)
/E (PLANS FOR THE FUTURE)
/Pg 40 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
1016 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (ENVIROMENTAL)
/E (ENVIROMENTAL)
/Pg 40 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
1017 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Our current journey is the culmination of a long-term vision set in motion years ago. We go beyond strategic and financial goals, striving to minimise negative consequences for people, communities, and the planet, while maximising positive social and environmental impact. )
/Pg 40 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
1018 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (RESPONSIBLE USE OF RESOURCES)
/E (RESPONSIBLE USE OF RESOURCES)
/Pg 40 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
1019 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Leveraging new digital technologies, we are on a continuous journey to reducing our paper use. Combined with responsible resource management, this approach minimizes our environmental footprint day by day. In our ongoing effort to minimise waste and enhance process efficiency, we actively promote digital tools as an alternative to traditional paper-based methods for contract and document circulation. We have invested heavily in document digitization, recognizing paper as a major source of unnecessary waste in everyday office operations. Our digital approach not only simplifies document archiving today, but also lays the foundation for a future with low paper consumption. )
/Pg 40 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
1020 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Our dedication to environmental stewardship extends to every aspect of our operations. We prioritize low-chemical and eco-friendly paper products such as toilet paper and paper towels. Moreover, all cleaning and sanitation products are biodigradable, demonstrating our commitment to minimizing our environmental impact. )
/Pg 40 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
1021 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (ENERGY CONSUMPTION)
/E (ENERGY CONSUMPTION)
/Pg 40 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
1022 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The renovation of our headquarters in Via Mazzini, 3 in Sassari marked the beginning of our journey towards sustainable energy management. This will bring long-term benefits over time.  By implementing measures such as thermal insulation of the facades and architectural paneling using Aluinvent panels \(secondary recycled raw materials\), we have seen significant improvements regarding our energy supply. This approach has demonstrably led to, and will continue to facilitate, significant reductions in CO2 emissions and economic savings.)
/Pg 40 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
1023 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Complementing these initiatives, we have installed solar panels on the roof with an electronic monitoring system, ensuring ongoing performance verification and data collection. This continuous monitoring with cutting-edge technology is vital. It allows us to gather valuable data on energy use, enabling us to optimize consumption over time. )
/Pg 40 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
1024 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (By analysing this energy consumption data from our meters and utility bills, we are able to track progress in reducing our environmental impact associated with energy use. )
/Pg 40 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
