/ActualText (WASTE MANAGEMENT)
/Pg 41 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
1035 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (We are dedicated to implementing responsible and sustainable waste management practices. This commitment includes collaboration with local waste disposal companies to ensure our waste follows a transparent and traceable disposal chain. Material recovery and regeneration are prioritised to minimise overall waste generation. Notably, a significant portion of our collected waste stream comprises paper and cardboard, which are recycled into new materials.  )
/Pg 41 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
