/ActualText (We value our employees and promote their personal and professional well-being. We encourage a healthy work-life balance and invest in specialised training to attract young talent. The initiatives we want to undertake reflect our continued commitment to creating an inclusive, sustainable, and forward-looking work environment, in line with our values and our status as a Benefit Corporation. )
