1045 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (We are dedicated to creating an environment that values and encourages the personal development of our employees. We always keep their well-being in mind, promoting a healthy work-life balance and allowing them to  reach their full potential. This approach helps our employees feel satisfied and proud to be part of our team.)
/Pg 42 0 R
/K [0]
>>
