1046 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (We want to further enhance the value or our human capital through work-life balance and corporate welfare initiatives. Specifically, one of our goals for 2024 is to continue implementing actions aimed at improving the work environment by monitoring the level of well-being and satisfaction of those who work with us. )
/Pg 42 0 R
/K [1]
