/ActualText (To ensure the successful implementation and ongoing effectiveness of our ESG strategy, we will adopt a multi-faceted approach. This includes direct oversight from our Board members, facilitating active dialogue between the Board and the Impact Manager to assess progress and identify potential areas for improvement. Additionally, we will actively engage our employees in ESG initiatives, building a shared sense of accountability and a more engaged corporate culture. )
