<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Building a sustainable future requires collaboration. Therefore we are selecting our suppliers and collaborators with strong sustainability practices. To promote transparency and accountability, we are ensuring that our partners meet sustainability standards and hold relevant certifications. By doing so, we are taking a step towards a more environmentally responsible supply chain. With a long-term vision, we are building a sustainable ecosystem. Our supplier selection process prioritises ESG practices, and we aim to lead the industry towards a more sustainable future and encourage an industry-wide collaboration on these important issues.)
/Pg 44 0 R
/K [13]
>>
