<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The publication of our first Impact Report signifies the start of our dedicated persuit towards integrating the principles of Corporate Social Responsibility \(CSR\) into the core of our organisation. Through this voluntary Impact Report, we demonstrate our commitment as a Benefit Corporation. We share the values and activities embedded in our 2023 strategies, setting a course for lasting impact in the years to come. Since our actions impact the environment and the local communities in which we operate, being recognised as a key player necessitates embracing sustainable development in our business decisions. )
